  (text "Block 2 + 3: Power path, battery protection, fuel gauge\n\n- USB-C input: CC pull-downs, ESD on CC/D+/D-/VBUS\n- 1S Li-ion charger with power-path management\n- 5V boost for CM5 +5V input, sized from datasheet worst-case current (TBD, Stage 2)\n- Battery protection: OVP / UVP / OCP / short circuit\n- I2C fuel gauge -> CM5 I2C\n\nOPEN: battery capacity and dimensions (not given yet)" (at 20 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 82c956cc-e7d6-4131-aced-3bba0b8998bc))
